            "created_at": "2025-08-23T09:29:05.255788+00:00",
            "notes": "Double boop allows us to burst down squishies along with  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429). That is why we pick it over  [Fast Forward](item_b5076f54-8bac-4202-9a7f-75b8c3d91633) at this point. With  [Fast Forward](item_b5076f54-8bac-4202-9a7f-75b8c3d91633), we would need to hit the crits. \n\n [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) is a huge burst of overhealth when we're using our cooldowns, which is generally when we're trying to combo someone. That single item can give us up to 100 overhealth in the span of 4 seconds. \n\nI used to pick  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) here, but that meant I didn't have enough damage to get solo picks most of the time. And while it helped me survive, my economy was hurting quite at bit after that. \n\nNow that I pick  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) in this spot, my economy has been much better, and I can already carry at this point in the game.",
