            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-23T09:29:05.255788+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where the build becomes OP. The really nasty part about [Fast Forward](item_b5076f54-8bac-4202-9a7f-75b8c3d91633) is that it also boosts the damage you deal with  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) and [Three-tap Tommygun] (yes, I've tested both). So now you have a lot of damage and kill power, on top of being extremely tanky and mobile. It's time to go full DPS (well, save that you should still amp up healing on your team when you can, especially your other support). \n\n [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) gives us more survivability and sustain, which is not as good as more burst damage, but we've ran out of easy ways to improve our burst damage, and Lumerico is such a massive boost that we can't pass up on it. \n\nWorth noting about [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), is that while it is active it constantly gives us armor, and the way that armor works is that even if you only have 1 point of armor, the incoming damage will be reduced by the full 7 (or half, or 30% depending on the source). So just having it running while taking damage will mitigate a lot of that damage, even when you're half-health or less.",
